# KBO/BCE open data dumps. Never commit these: ~2GB (GitHub rejects files
# over 100MB anyway), the FPS Economy licence covers use, not public
# redistribution, and contact.csv/address.csv hold real personal data —
# sole traders are natural persons, so their address, phone and email are
# in there. This repo is public. Only the *derived* patterns belong in git.
KboOpenData_*/
familiebudget/KboOpenData_*/
# The derived lookup index (backend/tools/build-kbo-index.mjs). Same reasons:
# it holds sole traders' names, and the licence covers use, not redistribution.
kbo-index.db
